and a little bit

00:27:31.770 --> 00:27:33.900
different from a lot of
the positioning of data

00:27:33.900 --> 00:27:39.330
science learning as
hard core data science.

00:27:39.330 --> 00:27:41.380
And I wonder if that's true.

00:27:41.380 --> 00:27:44.220
