00:35:26.410 --> 00:35:28.670
like, hey, where are you
trying to go in your life?

00:35:28.670 --> 00:35:31.840
What are you trying to do,
and how can Business Science

00:35:31.840 --> 00:35:33.650
best help you get there?

00:35:33.650 --> 00:35:37.720
And I think that's something
that's maybe a little weird--

00:35:37.720 --> 00:35:39.220
it could be a little
weird at first,

00:35:39.220 --> 00:35:42.700
but it's something unique
that I do that has really

00:35:42.700 --> 00:35:46.510
helped me identify with
people and really get

00:35:46.510 --> 00:35:48.010
to understand them more.

00:35:48.010 --> 00:35:50.950
And when I show them, OK,
this is how Business Science

00:35:50.950 --> 00:35:54.310
can help you grow if you're
trying to become a better data

00:35:54.310 --> 00:35:56.980
scientist, and also
working for my company.

00:35:59.860 --> 00:36:02.133
How does that relate to what
you're doing at Peloton?

00:36:05.280 --> 00:36:06.780
We can all get
better at leadership.

00:36:06.780 --> 00:36:09.450
And I think that that's
really-- when you're working--

00:36:09.450 --> 00:36:12.090
even if you're as a
project manager, where

00:36:12.090 --> 00:36:15.120
you aren't necessarily
overseeing people,

00:36:15.120 --> 00:36:18.930
but you do effectively have to
get them to do things in order

00:36:18.930 --> 00:36:21.640
to help you do the project--

00:36:21.640 --> 00:36:29.790
so just having that level
of leading by example

00:36:29.790 --> 00:36:34.740
and getting to know the
person, showing them

00:36:34.740 --> 00:36:38.010
how your project is going
to help them do better

00:36:38.010 --> 00:36:41.040
with whatever their
goals are and how

00:36:41.040 --> 00:36:43.500
it's going to help them
make things easier--

00:36:43.500 --> 00:36:46.140
make it easier for them
or increase their status

00:36:46.140 --> 00:36:48.210
in the company--

00:36:48.210 --> 00:36:48.930
simple things.

00:36:53.190 --> 00:36:55.378
People think people
are motivated by money

00:36:55.378 --> 00:36:55.920
all the time.

00:36:55.920 --> 00:36:58.020
That's a load of bull.

00:36:58.020 --> 00:37:02.820
What people are really motivated
by, honestly, is things--

00:37:02.820 --> 00:37:06.330
simple things, like recognition.

00:37:06.330 --> 00:37:07.980
If they're going to
be part of the team

00:37:07.980 --> 00:37:11.280
