manager, can really help.

00:37:29.560 --> 00:37:31.060
So I don't know if
that makes sense.

00:37:31.060 --> 00:37:33.180
I don't know if that's
helpful or not, but that's

00:37:33.180 --> 00:37:34.950
my two cents at least.

00:37:34.950 --> 00:37:36.600
Yeah, definitely,
